			send "%minimessage from "<gradient:#FF0000:#FF8600>NO REVELATION OF PERSONAL INFORMATION</gradient>"%%nl%&fDo not share another player's personal or private information, such as their name, address, bank details, etc. This rule is ZERO TOLERANCE and heavily enforced.%nl%"
			send formatted "<ttp:&aClick &fto go to the previous page!><run command:/rules 7>&7<< Previous Page<reset> &8| <ttp:&aClick &fto go to the next page!><run command:/rules 9>&7Next page »<reset>%nl%"
		else if arg-1 = 9:
