			send "%minimessage from "<gradient:#FF0000:#FF8600>NO INTERFERING WITH GAMEPLAY</gradient>"%%nl%&fDo not create contraptions, use exploits, or take actions that could crash or disrupt the server. All bugs should be reported to staff immediately. Failure to comply may result in a permanent ban or blacklist.%nl%"
			send formatted "<ttp:&aClick &fto go to the previous page!><run command:/rules 8>&7<< Previous Page<reset> &8| <ttp:&aClick &fto go to the next page!><run command:/rules 10>&7Next page »<reset>%nl%"
		else if arg-1 = 10:
